{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:48:01Z","input_tokens":3953,"cache_read_tokens":140260,"output_tokens":889,"content":"All changes are implemented. Here's the complete summary:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ What Was Done\n\nThe full analysis and implementation is in the [final report](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cbc8bff2-4be3-4f93-9be9-11c2e7ddb1fe/final-report.md). Key highlights:\n\n### 🔴 Critical Bug Fixed\n`passwordHash` was **never saved to the database** — it only existed in Node.js memory, so all passwords were lost on every server restart. Fixed: `passwordHash String?` added to [`prisma/schema.prisma`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/prisma/schema.prisma#L74) and [`lib/auth/passwordAuth.ts`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/lib/auth/passwordAuth.ts) now saves/reads it from DB.\n\n### 🔐 Auth Changes (6 files)\n| File | What Changed |\n|------|-------------|\n| [`prisma/schema.prisma`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/prisma/schema.prisma) | Added `passwordHash String?` to User |\n| [`lib/auth/passwordAuth.ts`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/lib/auth/passwordAuth.ts) | Email as primary ID, persists hash to DB, confirm password support |\n| [`app/api/auth/register/route.ts`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/app/api/auth/register/route.ts) | Accepts `email` (required) + `confirmPassword` |\n| [`components/AuthModal.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/components/AuthModal.tsx) | **Full rewrite** — OTP tab removed, show/hide passwords, password strength, terms checkbox |\n| [`app/login/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/NagrikOne/app/login/page.tsx) | **Full premium rewrite** — two-column layout, animated civic network, glassmorphism card |\n| [`app/globals.css`](file:///C:/Users/JAHID/.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\NagrikOne\\app\\globals.css) | +300 lines — all auth styles + 3D animation keyframes |\n\n### 🎨 Premium UI Added\n- Glassmorphism auth card with ambient cyan/violet orb glow\n- **Two-column login page**: animated civic network visual (left) + auth card (right)\n- Slow-rotating rings, floating service node chips (Municipal, Consumer, Utility, Banking)\n- Password strength bar, show/hide toggles, smooth tab transitions\n- `prefers-reduced-motion` supported\n\n### 🔒 OTP Backend Preserved\n`lib/auth/otp.ts`, `app/api/auth/otp/route.ts`, and `OtpVerification` DB model are **all untouched** — OTP is simply removed from the UI, ready to reintroduce later.\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ First thing you must do when running locally:\n\n```bash\n# After npm install, apply the schema change:\nnpm run db:push\n```\n\nThis adds `passwordHash` to your PostgreSQL `User` table — **without this, registration will fail**."}
